## Mensaje al usuario (plantilla)

Antes del push, mostrar:

```
✅ Pre-push gate (obligatorio — un solo comando)
  Comando: pnpm run validate:pre-push:win
  - format:check (Prettier): PASS/FAIL
  - lint: PASS/FAIL
  - typecheck: PASS/FAIL
  - frontend test: PASS/FAIL
  - frontend build: PASS/FAIL
  - dotnet test: PASS/FAIL
  - dotnet build Release: PASS/FAIL
  - EF migrations: PASS/FAIL
  - gitleaks: PASS/FAIL
  → RESULTADO GLOBAL: PASS/FAIL (exit code)
```

Solo tras **RESULTADO GLOBAL: PASS** → `git add` → `git commit` → `git push`.
